I see what’s happening in your script — you mixed up the options object and the driver object. Right now you’re creating drivers = UiAutomator2Options() and then overwriting it with webdriver.Remote(...). That makes it confusing, and also your adb_exec_timeout line is being applied to a variable (options) that doesn’t exist in your code.

